<title>TAIWAN: China Development 1996 sales up 9.17 pct.</title>
<headline>China Development 1996 sales up 9.17 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>China Development Corp, one of Taiwan's leading venture capital and investment firms, said on Wednesday its 1996 sales revenues rose 9.17 percent to T$6.98 billion from 1995.</p>
<p>In December, China Development's sales were down 15.97 percent to T$555.82 million from December 1995, a company statement said.</p>
<p>It gave no profit figures.</p>
<p>The statement also listed sales for its trust funds, which soared 172.42 percent to T$2.21 billion in 1996 from 1995 and rose 124.33 percent to T$206 million in December 1996 from the year-earlier period.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
